\newlabel{fig:tool-layer-classification}{{4.6}{26}{Layer-classification decision flow. Each symbol's tokens are matched against priority-ordered lexicons (system, middleware, low-level, application); the first match determines the layer with an associated confidence}{figure.caption.33}{}}
